# Track only hand-written config: skills, agents and hooks. Everything else in ~/.claude is
# session data, history, caches, plugins or credentials, and must stay out of git.
# settings.json is left out too: add it deliberately, after checking it holds no tokens.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/skills/
!/agents/
!/hooks/
!/tests/
__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
# Agent evaluation output: large, and holds full agent replies.
/tests/agent-evals/results/
